d><mn>19.6</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>64</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mroot><mn>6</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>19.6</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>49</mn><mroot><mn>36</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>π</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.94</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>cm</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mtext>min</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nrounded to two decimal places.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the solution level is increasing at a rate of approximately <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"304\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mj